  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4024.02 Scope. This part shall apply to any person licensed to receive, possess, own, acquire, use, process, transfer, or dispose of radioactive material, and to any person responsible for decommissioning a facility or site.\n\nSource. #8393, eff 7-23-05; ss by #10492, eff 12-24-13; ss by #13997, eff 6-12-24",
